    "why": "The slide states that a 30-second delay eliminates the recency effect, which matches the option about inserting a 30-second delay. The question bank keys counting backward because the stem asks what prevents rehearsal. In the original delay study, participants counted backward during the 30 seconds, and that counting is what prevented rehearsal of the last words.",
